        <type>uint64_t</type>
        <definition>uint64_t data[1]</definition>
        <argsstring>[1]</argsstring>
        <name>data</name>
        <qualifiedname>ndigo_packet::data</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Sample data. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>For the Ndigo5G each 64-bit word contains four 16bit signed words from the ADC.</para>
<para>The user can cast the array to <computeroutput>short*</computeroutput> to directly operate on the sample data. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
